      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "RESCUE MISSION - Wednesday evening, the Laredo Air Branch responded to a call from U.S. Border Patrol Laredo Sector about a group of illegal aliens in distress near Carrizo Springs, TX. \n\nTwo AS350 crews launched immediately for a critical search and rescue mission. The teams quickly located the distressed group and landed near two individuals that were in dire condition—one juvenile and one adult suffering from heat-related injuries. The aircrews who are also certified EMTs, provided immediate life-saving care before safely turning them over to the U.S. Border Patrol.\n\nDo not attempt to cross the border illegally as you will be caught and removed. Illegal border crossing is extremely dangerous and could cost you your life!  #LaredoAirBranch #SAR #BorderSecurity",
      "text_resolved": "RESCUE MISSION - Wednesday evening, the Laredo Air Branch responded to a call from U.S. Border Patrol Laredo Sector about a group of illegal aliens in distress near Carrizo Springs, TX. \n\nTwo AS350 crews launched immediately for a critical search and rescue mission. The teams quickly located the distressed group and landed near two individuals that were in dire condition—one juvenile and one adult suffering from heat-related injuries. The aircrews who are also certified EMTs, provided immediate life-saving care before safely turning them over to the U.S. Border Patrol.\n\nDo not attempt to cross the border illegally as you will be caught and removed. Illegal border crossing is extremely dangerous and could cost you your life!  #LaredoAirBranch #SAR #BorderSecurity",
