      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "On September 9, a New Orleans Air and Marine Branch AS350  aircrew along with Gulfport Marine Unit Agents partnered with ICE and USBP on an operation in Ocean Springs, MS. This joint operation led to the arrest of multiple illegal aliens.  Several subjects attempted to flee but where no match for the eyes in the sky that were watching. All are now in USBP custody for processing. Together, we stand strong in protecting our communities! 🇺🇸 #OneTeamOneMission",
